    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:</i>&nbsp;<i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Manufactured By:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Empress_Teta\" title=\"Empress Teta\">Empress Teta</a> (Planet) </p><p><b>Applicable To:</b> Any Armor, Any Ranged Energy Weapon </p><p>Cinnagaran Manufacture items are manufactured on the sprawling metropolis world of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Empress_Teta\" title=\"Empress Teta\">Empress Teta</a>, which has been at the center of galactic wars for over a thousand years. </p><p><b>Weapons:</b> Cinnagaran Weapons deal both Energy and Bludgeoning damage. </p><p><b>Armors:</b> Cinnagaran Manufacture Armor and Shields grant <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a> 5 against weapons that deal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Sonic\" title=\"Sonic\">Sonic</a> damage, but it's Maximum <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> Bonus is reduced by 1. </p>",
